// The application manifest resource of every Windows executable Zodiac ships or builds (application.manifest): resource 1 of type 24
// (CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID, RT_MANIFEST). Compiled into zodiac.exe and zodiacw.exe, and into lib/release/zodiac_manifest.obj,
// which zodiac build links into every game. It must stay the only resource script that emits RT_MANIFEST 1 into an executable: a future
// .rc of zodiac, zodiacw or a game (an icon, version information) must not declare a manifest of its own; entries go into
// application.manifest instead.
1 24 "application.manifest"
